  "description": "Cheryl, determined to escape from her boring rural island, works hard every day to earn money. Then one day, she encounters a mermaid-like creature born from a 'stone' she found(?) and hopes that selling the child will make her money... From that day on, for some reason, she keeps having lewd dreams with a man.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Inoe Danpyeonseon (인외 단편선) Collection.*",
